[{"id":3479101680,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7PXuDw","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally (including `make_rst.py`), it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node2D\r\n\r\n## This is a test comment.[br]\r\n## [note]This is a [code]note[/code].[/note][br]\r\n## [warning]This is a [code]warning[/code].[/warning][br]\r\n## [tip]This is a [code]tip[/code].[/tip][br]\r\n## [important]This is [code]important[/code].[/important][br]\r\n## More text following admonitions.\r\nvar test = 1\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tprint(test)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Modern theme\r\n\r\nDefault | Light\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"343\" height=\"172\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8bf3798c-2679-4555-bd11-58fea3d1d389\" /> | <img width=\"343\" height=\"172\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c38f753-e002-4f0c-bbab-915ead7eddec\" />\r\n\r\n### Classic theme\r\n\r\nDefault | Light\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"343\" height=\"172\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ff1e9d2-0a99-43c1-b167-71f95b99bd83\" /> | <img width=\"343\" height=\"172\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5329e329-4d27-41c4-89da-3fbaea577f8f\" />\r\n\r\n### `make_rst.py` output in godot-docs\r\n\r\n*Use `--doctool --gdscript-docs /path/to/project`, then `doc/tools/make_rst.py /path/to/project/docs/class_node_2d.gd.xml` and copy `class_node_2d.gd.rst` to the `classes` folder of godot-docs.*\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"833\" height=\"1286\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f6df30f-cd1b-4738-b657-d6e768635440\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nPS: `important` admonitions appear green in both dark and light theme in the generated Sphinx documentation, I'm not sure why. They were normally either yellow or orange as I recall.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#pullrequestreview-3479101680","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111375","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#pullrequestreview-3479101680"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111375"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-18T18:02:59Z","commit_id":"0ae57c5d61280dfecffc24f1ae2759a2deeaf9ad"},{"id":4372441593,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBJ4p-Q","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subsc